{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1430024-forthcoming-vtm-material","id":1430024,"title":"Forthcoming VtM material","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-26T19:05:27-08:00","id":1430024,"title":"Forthcoming VtM material","content":"Forthcoming VtM material in 2021 include;<ul><li><u>V5</u>: <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cults_of_the_Blood_Gods\" target=\"_blank\">Cults of the Blood Gods</a></li> <li><u>V5</u>: <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire:_The_Masquerade_-_Bloodlines_2\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Masquerade - Bloodlines 2</a></li> <li><u>V5</u>: Vampire: The Masquerade - Out for Blood (Spring)</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Vampire: The Masquerade - Parliament of Knives (Summer)</li> <li><u>V5</u>: <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire:_The_Masquerade_-_Swansong\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Masquerade - Swansong</a></li> </ul><br /> Forthcoming VtM material at some point in the future include;<ul><li><u>V5</u>: Sabbat. About the Sword of Caine after the Gehenna Crusade</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Second Inquisition. About the mortal groups hunting vampires.</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Trail of Bone and Ashes (Cults of the Blood Gods reward) \u201c\u2026a political playable story in which we explore the burning enmities of the Cappadocians, Harbingers, Samedi, Giovanni, and Lamiae, and whether, in the historic domain of Florence, they can ever be repaired.\u201d</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Forbidden Faiths (Cults of the Blood Gods reward) \u201c\u2026featuring a chapter focusing on cults dedicated to power through fear, influence, or devotion, including worshipers of the Nictuku, errant houses within the Tremere, and the ancestral obsession of the Ventrue.\u201d</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Faithful Undead (Cults of the Blood Gods reward) \u201c\u2026a section that contains new Storyteller-played Characters to act as supporting characters and antagonists in a new chronicle.\u201d</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Children of the Blood (Cults of the Blood Gods reward) I think this is \u201cFaithful Undead\u201d retitled.</li> <li><u>V5</u>: Evil afoot. A book about evil vampire footwear.</li> </ul><br /> Have I missed anything?<br /> <br /> Does anyone have any dates more specific than 2021?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-26T19:23:40-08:00","id":1430029,"title":"","content":"I believe Trail of Bone and Ashes is the LET THE STREETS RUN RED equivalent with multiple Chronicles within it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\"